mage/upload/t_thumb/sc14yro.jpg"}, {"id": 1911304, "url": "//images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_thumb/sc14yrs.jpg"}, {"id": 1911305, "url": "//images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_thumb/sc14yrt.jpg"}, {"id": 1911306, "url": "//images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_thumb/sc14yru.jpg"}], "slug": "bloody-duke", "storyline": "The Siege of Caerwyn marked the end of the Great Collapse - and the end of humanity as it was known.\n\nPlay as Duke Blaise Vaelthorne - 35th Duke of Caerwyn, Warden of the White City, Protector of Cassenbrooke, Black Phoenix, Hegemon of Men, and the Unyielding Defender against the Great Collapse. Blaise was one of the very few survivors of the Great Collapse, cursed by the Giver of Curses during the Siege of Caerwyn to live for eternity, watching his world fall and die. Broken and tormented, he takes up Erinyes, a conscious, vengeful blade, to carry out his revenge.\n\nEndure the path from the Suowick River Bank to Caerwyn, the White Capital City of the dukedom. Fight your way through nightmarish monsters and resist the temptation to surrender to the Legion of Asgarand. By Right. By Blood.", "summary": "Bloody Duke is a 2.5D dark-fantasy action-adventure game with souls-like combat, set in a world inspired by Transylvanian, Slavic, Latin and Celtic Mythology. Play as the cursed Duke Blaise Vaelthorne fighting his way back to the Phoenix Throne, wielding the sentient blade Erinyes and making risky pacts with the Devil along the way!", "themes": [{"id": 1, "name": "Action"}, {"id": 17, "name": "Fantasy"}, {"id": 31, "name": "Drama"}, {"id": 43, "name": "Mystery"}], "url": "https://www.igdb.com/games/bloody-duke", "videos": [{"id": 194464, "name": "Trailer", "video_id": "9CPfVD5Y-RI", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=9CPfVD5Y-RI", "title": "Bloody Duke - Official Demo Trailer", "thumb": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/9CPfVD5Y-RI/fhddefault.jpg"}, {"id": 194465, "name": "Announcement Trailer", "video_id": "WtREVMw_n54", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=WtREVMw_n54", "title": "Bloody Duke - Teaser Trailer", "thumb": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/WtREVMw_n54/maxresdefault.jpg"}]}